---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — AI Tools for Game Devs">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">About this directory</h1>

    <p class="text-ink-muted">
      AI tools for game development are exploding — and most directories are auto-generated link farms
      or pay-to-rank catalogs. This one is different:
    </p>

    <ul class="space-y-3 text-ink-muted">
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Task-first taxonomy.</strong> Categories match what you need to do (skyboxes, VO, QA), not vendor buzzwords.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Engine tags.</strong> Every tool is tagged Unity / Unreal / Godot / engine-agnostic, because that's the first question a game dev asks.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Tested badges.</strong> Tools we personally ran get a ✅ Tested badge — everything else is honestly marked ⏳ Unverified.</li>
      <li><strong class="text-ink">Never pay-to-rank.</strong> Listings are free and editorial. Rankings are never sold.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="text-ink-muted">
      Curated by someone who works inside the game industry and ships with these tools weekly.
      Missing something? <a href="/submit" class="text-violet-600 underline dark:text-violet-400">Submit a tool</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
